{"title": "Gontr Mael: Glowing", "pageid": 27732, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Gontr_Mael:_Glowing", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features", "Toggleable passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Light.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Light.webp/300px-Light.webp, /w/images/e/e2/Light.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Light.webp/300px-Light.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Light.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Gontr Mael: Glowing</b> is a toggleable passive feature granted by <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gontr_Mael\" title=\"Gontr Mael\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Gontr_Mael_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Gontr_Mael_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Gontr_Mael_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Gontr_Mael_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Gontr_Mael_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Gontr_Mael_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Gontr_Mael_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Gontr_Mael_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a4/Gontr_Mael_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gontr_Mael\" title=\"Gontr Mael\">Gontr Mael</a>. It causes the bow to emit a light around the equipped weapon.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This object shines with a glowing light in a radius of 6 m (20 ft). Toggle this to douse and rekindle the light. \n</p><p>Toggle this to douse and rekindle the light.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"Loading Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Toggleable</span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Light\"> Condition: Light </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Light_(Condition)\" title=\"Light (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Light\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Light_(Condition)\" title=\"Light (Condition)\">Light</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>This object has an aura of light with a radius of 7.5 m (25 ft).</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id